They want someone to come in and build the machine.

But usually there=E2=80=99s not enough there yet.

The ICP is still moving.
The sales motion isn=E2=80=99t fully repeatable.
The founder is still too involved in too many deals.
A lot of the early wins came from force of personality, not real process.

So the new leader walks into a role where they=E2=80=99re supposed to creat=
e scale before the company is ready for it.

That=E2=80=99s where things start to break.

I=E2=80=99m not saying this from a distance. I=E2=80=99ve been that hire, b=
rought in to scale before the motion was really ready.

